      "content": "Rangbaz (Bengali: রংবাজ ) is an 2017 Bangladeshi gangster film directed by Shamim Ahamed Roni and Abdul Mannan. It is produced by Shrikant Mohta and Mahendra Soni under the banners of SVF Entertainment and Ruprong Films Limited. The film marks SVF Entertainment's first Bangladeshi venture and it is also the first film of SVF Entertainment to be only releasing in Bangladesh. The film stars Shakib Khan and features Shabnom Bubly as his love interest. It also features Rajatava Dutta, Amit Hasan, Chikon Ali, and Sadek Bachchu in supporting roles. The film release on september 2, 2017, to coincide with Eid al-Adha in Bangladesh.",
